    <briefdescription>
<para>This type defines the behavior following the thin-link phase during ThinLTO. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It encapsulates a backend function and a strategy for thread pool parallelism. Clients should use one of the provided create*ThinBackend() functions to instantiate a <ref refid="structllvm_1_1lto_1_1_thin_backend" kindref="compound">ThinBackend</ref>. Parallelism defines the thread pool strategy to be used for processing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
